{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"二十有九年春，介葛廬來。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"公至自圍許。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"夏六月，會王人、晉人、宋人、齊人、陳人、蔡人、秦人盟于翟泉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"秋，大雨雹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"冬，介葛廬來。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"二十九年春，介葛廬來朝，舍于昌衍之上。公在會，饋之芻米，禮也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"夏，公會王子虎、晉狐偃、宋公孫固、齊國歸父、陳轅濤塗、秦小子憖，盟于翟泉，尋踐土之盟，且謀伐鄭也。卿不書，罪之也。在禮，卿不會公、侯，會伯、子、男可也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"秋，大雨雹，為災也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_92_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_92","textTraditional":"冬，介葛廬來，以未見公，故復來朝，禮之，加燕好。介葛廬聞牛鳴，曰：「是生三犧，皆用之矣，其音云。」問之而信。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}